 casterbikeclub.net/cue/lm-landisville-mount-joy-loop/)\n\nTour de Red Rose
  & LBC Notes:\n\nCheck Google Groups for Ride Conditions\, Route Changes a
 nd Weather Updates. [Join here](https://groups.google.com/forum/?hl=en#!fo
 rum/lancasterbikeclub) if you are not already part of this group.\n\nHelme
 ts are mandatory\; please also plan to bring 1-2 water bottles\, and basic
  repair kit (spare tube\, tire levers\, pump/CO2 inflator).\n\nBeing a Mee
 tup Member does not mean you are a club member. [Join here](https://www.la
 ncasterbikeclub.net/content.aspx?page_id=60&club_id=257148).\nYour RSVP is
  your agreement to abide by the club's [Code of Conduct](https://lancbikec
 lub.clubexpress.com/content.aspx?page_id=22&club_id=257148&module_id=32398
 4) and [Rules of the Road](https://lancbikeclub.clubexpress.com/content.as
 px?page_id=22&club_id=257148&module_id=325159)\, and [Ride Waiver](https:/
 /lancasterbikeclub.net/docs.ashx?id=454318).
