SUMMARY:FUN RIDE - LM Landisville Mount Joy Loop (19R) RSVP Required
DESCRIPTION:Lancaster Bicycle Club (LBC) Meetup\nRide leader: Volunteer to
  lead!\nRide Sweep: Volunteer to Sweep\nAnticipated Average Pace: \\~11 mp
 h\nRoute: [LM Landisville Mount Joy Loop (19R)](https://routes.lancasterbi
 keclub.net/cue/lm-landisville-mount-joy-loop/)\n\n**Be Safe\, Have Fun\, a
 nd Ride Together**\n\nWithout a volunteer leader\, this event is Show and 
 Go.\nThe departure location AND THE ROUTE are the same as the Tour de Red 
 Rose\, just an hour later\, so there will be other cyclists to help.\nIf y
 ou want to volunteer to lead\, leave a comment for this ride\, or contact 
 Rick Zook.\n\nThis is a FUN RIDE ride. The ride leader will ride at the ad
 vertised average speed. This is intended to be a group ride with a no-drop
  rule as the main goal. The ride leader will do his/her best to keep the g
 roup together with occasional regroupings and/or splitting into multiple g
 roups to align to pace capabilities.\n\nPlease do not join this ride if yo
 u are not willing to ride with the group.\n\nHelmets are mandatory. No ear
 buds. Please bring water and a basic repair kit (spare tube\, tire levers\
 , pump/CO2 inflator).\n\nTo eliminate passing around a pen and paper waive
 r\, we require LBC Club membership and Meetup RSVP below to join this ride
 . Being on Meetup does not mean you are a club member. Join here [Member S
 ignup](https://www.lancasterbikeclub.net/content.aspx?page_id=60&club_id=2
 57148)\nYour RSVP is your agreement to abide by the club's Code of Conduct
 : [Code of Conduct](https://www.lancasterbikeclub.net/content.aspx?page_id
 =22&club_id=257148&module_id=323984)\n\nGuidance if an incident occurs: [I
 ncident Actions](https://lancasterbikeclub.net/content.aspx?page_id=22&clu
 b_id=257148&module_id=326137)
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/lancaster-bicycle-club/events/3154881
 01/
